  "description": "✨ Lady Finger Soda – Playful Display Bubble Font\nAdd a splash of fun, sweetness, and bubbly energy to your designs with Lady Finger Soda! This playful display bubble font is perfect for creators who want to make a bold, cheerful, and friendly statement. Inspired by puffy letters and sweet treats, its soft, rounded edges and shiny highlights give it a unique 3D bubble effect that instantly catches the eye.\nWhether you’re creating cute merchandise, quirky packaging, or vibrant social media graphics, this font is ready to bring your imagination to life!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>✨ Lady Finger Soda – Playful Display Bubble Font</p>\n<p>Add a splash of fun, sweetness, and bubbly energy to your designs with Lady Finger Soda! This playful display bubble font is perfect for creators who want to make a bold, cheerful, and friendly statement. Inspired by puffy letters and sweet treats, its soft, rounded edges and shiny highlights give it a unique 3D bubble effect that instantly catches the eye.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating cute merchandise, quirky packaging, or vibrant social media graphics, this font is ready to bring your imagination to life!</p>",
